        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>战争</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 20px 40px 20px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  thead th {\n    background: #4a67b0;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 7px 6px;\n    border: 1px solid #ffffff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  tbody td {\n    border: 1px solid #c9c9c9;\n    padding: 6px 6px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n  }\n  tbody tr:nth-child(odd) td {\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  col.c1 { width: 13%; }\n  col.c2 { width: 27%; }\n  col.c3 { width: 60%; }\n  .red { color: #d32f2f; font-weight: 700; }\n  .blue { color: #1f4fa8; font-weight: 700; }\n  .bold { font-weight: 700; }\n  .watermark-zone {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 0;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 8px;\n    top: -78px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #9a9a9a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .watermark .logo {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    border: 1px solid #b5b5b5;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n    vertical-align: -2px;\n  }\n  .watermark .from {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1 class=\"title\">战争</h1>\n\n<table>\n  <colgroup>\n    <col class=\"c1\"><col class=\"c2\"><col class=\"c3\">\n  </colgroup>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>时间</th>\n      <th>战争</th>\n      <th>考点</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"red\">1066开始</span></td>\n      <td>诺曼征服 The Norman Conquest</td>\n      <td>\n        1.William the Conqueror (William I)威廉一世(征服者)，<br>\n        2.两种语言Anglo-Saxon 和Norman语<br>\n        3. 1086年The Domesday Book末日书威廉一世的土地调查记录\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1066年</td>\n      <td>黑斯廷斯之战Battle of Hastings</td>\n      <td>Bayeux tapestry (贝叶挂毯) 记录了该战争。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1314</td>\n      <td>班诺克本战役 Bannockburn</td>\n      <td>\n        1.the Scottish king Robert the Bruce第一次苏格兰独立战争<br>\n        2.来自苏格兰的君主：king Robert the Bruce罗伯特<br>\n        3.来自何士的君主：查理二世（就是流亡那个）\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1337至1453年</td>\n      <td>英法百年战争Hundred Years War</td>\n      <td>英、法两国百余年间断续进行的战争</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1455－1485</td>\n      <td>玫瑰之战Wars of Roses</td>\n      <td>约克和兰卡斯特家族对战</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><span class=\"red\">1588这个时间考</span></td>\n      <td>英国海军 打败西班牙无敌舰队<br>伊丽莎白一世</td>\n      <td>the English defeated the Spanish Armada打败西班牙无敌舰队，标志着日不落帝国的崛起。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1642–1646<br>查理一世</td>\n      <td>英国内战 Civil War 第一次</td>\n      <td>\n        1.保皇派和国会的斗争<br>\n        2.<span class=\"red\">保皇派=the Cavalier</span><br>\n        3.国会=Parliament=The Roundheads（圆头是国会，议员都滑头）\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1648–1649<br>查理二世</td>\n      <td>英国内战Civil War第二次</td>\n      <td>\n        著名战役：<br>\n        1644The Battle of Marston Moor马斯顿荒原战役<br>\n        1645The Battle of Naseby纳西比战役\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1649–1651<br>查理二世</td>\n      <td>英国内战Civil War第三次</td>\n      <td>\n        1.查理一世被处死1649年；defeated by Oliver Cromwell 被克伦威尔打败；<br>\n        2. 查理二世流亡苟兰，躲到一个oak树下面<br>\n        4.克伦威尔死了1658年，查理二世又回来复辟即位。<br>\n        <span class=\"red\">（一世老爸处死、二世儿子流亡）</span>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1815</td>\n      <td>滑铁卢之战Battle of Waterloo</td>\n      <td>英国和法国最后一战য়；世拿破仑一世的最后一战</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1853 to 1856</td>\n      <td>克里米亚战争Crimean War －<br>英国/Russia打</td>\n      <td>是第一场被媒体通过新闻报道和照片广泛报道的战争。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1899 to 1902</td>\n      <td>波尔战争The Boer War</td>\n      <td><span class=\"bold\">South Africa</span> with settlers from the <span class=\"bold\">Netherlands</span> called the <span class=\"bold\">Boers</span>．（荷兰移民–南非–波尔战争）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1914－<span class=\"red\">1918</span>年</td>\n      <td>一战 11.11.11结束</td>\n      <td>\n        1.一战爆发原因:1914奥地利Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austri被刺杀<br>\n        2.一战后女性贡献，开始有投票权30岁\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1939 －1945</td>\n      <td>二战</td>\n      <td>AIR WWII德国入侵波兰是二战开始 <span class=\"red\">1939会考</span></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>敦刻尔克大撤退Dunkirk spirit 精神</td>\n      <td>是第二次世界大战初期的英法联军的军事撤退行动</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1940</td>\n      <td>不列颠之战Battle of Britain<br>英/德空军之战</td>\n      <td>aerial battle between Germany and Britain in the summer<br>(空军–英国和德国–二战)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>The Battle of Trafalgar</td>\n      <td>Admiral Nelson</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"watermark-zone\">\n  <div class=\"watermark\">\n    <span class=\"logo\"></span>@家务温书\n    <span class=\"from\">From 小红书</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
